Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?Na=C4=9Fmedar:=20audio=20filters=20beside=20the?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20equalizer,=20and=20a=20dialogue=20boost?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

libvlc_audio_set_filters() adds audio filters ("compressor:nagdialogue")
that stay in the chain when the equalizer is set, and
libvlc_audio_set_filter_float() changes a filter's option on the fly.
The nagdialogue filter raises the dialogue: the centre channel of a
multichannel mix, or the voice band of what both stereo channels share.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
